<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/10th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Campaign</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sviatoslav's campaign against the Khazars</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">960s</span> · <a href="/centuries/10th-century">10th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sviatoslav-i-of-kiev">Sviatoslav</a>'s campaign against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khazar-khaganate">Khazars</a> was a series of military expeditions by the prince of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kievan-rus">Kievan Rus</a> in the 960s. He captured <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sarkel">Sarkel</a> and other Khazar centres. The Khazar Khaganate profile treats it as a blow from which the khaganate never recovered.</p></div>
